        "Content": "Cam Lake View, Aughalough Aughavas, Co. Leitrim — H12CH76\r\n\r\nAbbey Property Sales offer this fantastic four-bedroom bungalow to the market, set in a most beautiful countryside locations in County Leitrim.\r\n\r\nIf you’re looking for a home that combines space, comfort, privacy and breathtaking countryside surroundings, this wonderful property is certainly worth viewing.\r\n\r\nSet on an elevated site overlooking Cam Lake, the property enjoys wonderful lake views and panoramic countryside scenery. It is a truly peaceful setting where you can sit back, relax and enjoy countryside living at its very best.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you arrive, the property makes a fantastic impression. The manicured gardens are beautifully maintained and provide an attractive setting around the house, while the elevated position gives the property that extra sense of space and outlook.\r\n\r\nInside, the bungalow is presented in showhouse condition, offering a warm, welcoming and beautifully maintained home ready for its new owners to simply move in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nThe property features four bedrooms, providing excellent accommodation for family living, visiting guests or those looking for additional rooms for working from home or hobbies.\r\n\r\nThe lovely painted kitchen is both practical and attractive and comes complete with all appliances, making it ready for immediate use.\r\n\r\nOutside, there is an impressive range of additional facilities. The property benefits from a large garage, along with a workshop, toilet, potting house and is ideal for anyone with an interest in gardening, DIY, storage or hobbies.\r\n\r\nAnd then there is the setting.\r\nThe combination of the elevated position, Cam Lake views, open countryside and beautifully maintained gardens gives this property a special atmosphere that is difficult to replicate. Imagine starting your morning looking out across the lake, enjoying the peace and quiet of the countryside, while still having a spacious and practical family home with excellent outside facilities.\r\n\r\nCountryside living at its very best — and a property that really needs to be seen to be appreciated.\r\nCam Lake View, Aughavas, Co. Leitrim — a wonderful home in a truly special setting.\r\n\r\nAccommodation.\r\n\r\nPorch. 2.63 m x 0.98 m. tiled area with slide door.\r\nEntrance Hall. (4.34 m x 1.82 m) plus (10.30 m x 1.04 m.) lovely bright area with coving & carpet.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room. large room with painted kitchen with appliances, tiled floors, back door, two windows for extra light.\r\n\r\nSitting Room. 4.39 m x 3.99 m. lovely bright room with views over the countryside, two windows for dual aspect, coving, stove. laminated flooring.\r\n\r\nLiving Room. 4.35 m x 3.65 m. two windows for dual aspect, coving, parquet flooring. currently home office.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1. 3.69 m x 3.27 m. bright room with carpet.\r\n\r\nWC. 2.03 m x 1.07 m. tiled room with whb & wc.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2. 3.10 m x 2.50 m. built in wardrobe, carpet and countryside views.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3. 3.12 m x 2.82 m. bright room with countryside views, carpet.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4. 3.13 m x 3.04 m. bright room with views, carpet.\r\n\r\nBathroom. 3.27 m x 2.20 m. fully tiled room with shower, whb & wc.\r\n\r\nGarage. (5.54 m x 3.10 m) plus (4.53 m x 3.10 m) large garage with two sections plus toilet 2.87 m x 1.18 m.\r\nWork shop. 4.09 m x 3.45 m.\r\n\r\nThis is a must see property.\r\n\r\nCall Gerry on 086 8066701 for further information or to arrange a viewing.\r\n\r\nAll information provided is to the best of our knowledge, information & belief. The utmost care and attention on our part has been placed on providing factual and correct information. Please note that in certain instances some information may have been provided directly by the vendor to ourselves. Whilst due attention and care is taken in preparing particulars, this firm does not hold itself responsible for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get a professional opinion on any concern they may have."
